19
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:38,870
It is not.

20
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:40,260
It is a picture.

21
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,000
e is a story about growth.

22
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:45,210
