34
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:10,990
for what it really is.

35
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,050
Not a decimal.

36
00:01:12,450 --> 00:01:13,430
A kind of growth.

37
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,740
Imagine a bank that pays one

38
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:17,310
hundred percent interest per year.

39
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:19,020
Put in one dollar, and

40
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:20,450
