50
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:39,790
Every single day, two seventy one.

51
00:01:40,650 --> 00:01:42,120
Keep splitting the year finer

52
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:43,480
and finer, and the total

53
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,910
does not run off to infinity.

54
00:01:45,330 --> 00:01:46,810
It settles on one number.

55
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,740
Two point seven one eight.

56
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,450
That number is e.

57
00:01:51,330 --> 00:01:52,710
Here is what makes it special.

58
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:54,140
When interest is paid

59
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:55,900
continuously, your money grows at

60
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:57,610
